          "message": {
            "text": "An unauthenticated callback or health route on trace-collector accepts requests that downstream code treats as if they had come from intake-agent. Because trace-collector serves the Operations Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of prompts, completions and tool traces at once. Until the credential is revoked the attacker acts with the victim's authority, and the audit trail attributes the actions to the victim. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and LOW impact because the effect is contained and easy to reverse once it is noticed.",
