        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/tampering",
          "message": {
            "text": "Replay of an earlier valid update to free-text shipment requests reaches intake-agent because updates carry no nonce or expiry, restoring a state the owner already corrected. intake-agent runs in the Agent Runtime Zone and exchanges free-text shipment requests with embed-service-2 over gRPC over mTLS, so anything able to reach embed-service-2 can also reach this weakness. Altered data is then treated as authoritative by every consumer, so the damage spreads before anyone compares it with the source. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Add a nonce and a short expiry to every update accepted by intake-agent, store seen nonces for the validity window and reject any repeat. Name an owner for this control, review it each quarter and route violations to trace-collector so that responders see them in one place."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
