        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/tampering",
          "message": {
            "text": "An attacker who can write to the channel between feature-store-2 and summarizer-llm modifies shipment records fed into summaries in transit because messages carry no integrity protection of their own. summarizer-llm runs in the Agent Runtime Zone and exchanges shipment records fed into summaries with feature-store-2 over gRPC over mTLS, so anything able to reach feature-store-2 can also reach this weakness. The change can persist across restarts and restores, which makes the original state difficult to prove and to recover. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Sign messages between feature-store-2 and summarizer-llm with a per-service key and verify the signature and a monotonic counter before accepting any change. Add a regression test for this abuse path to the CI suite and alert through trace-collector when the control fires."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
