        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/tampering",
          "message": {
            "text": "A race between concurrent writers lets an attacker overwrite ranking and fine-tuning features on feature-store-2 after validation but before use, defeating the earlier check. summarizer-llm trusts feature-store-2 to pass ranking and fine-tuning features along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. Altered data is then treated as authoritative by every consumer, so the damage spreads before anyone compares it with the source. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Make validation and use atomic: take a version-checked write or compare-and-set on ranking and fine-tuning features, and reject updates whose version no longer matches. Name an owner for this control, review it each quarter and route violations to trace-collector so that responders see them in one place."
          },
