        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/tampering",
          "message": {
            "text": "Unsanitised replayed traces and judge verdicts reach eval-runner and are processed as trusted structure, so crafted input changes how later steps interpret the record. eval-runner runs in the Operations Zone and exchanges replayed traces and judge verdicts with trace-collector over gRPC over mTLS, so anything able to reach trace-collector can also reach this weakness. Altered data is then treated as authoritative by every consumer, so the damage spreads before anyone compares it with the source. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
