            ],
            "affected_assets": []
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/repudiation",
          "message": {
            "text": "Failed and rejected attempts against planner-agent are not logged, so probing of task plans and tool selections leaves no trace that an investigator could use. Because planner-agent serves the Agent Runtime Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of task plans and tool selections at once. Incident responders lose the sequence of events, which delays containment and weakens any later accountability claim. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and LOW impact because the effect is contained and easy to reverse once it is noticed.",
            "markdown": "Log denied and malformed requests to planner-agent at a retained severity, aggregate them per source and alert on sustained probing. Verify the control in a pre-production exercise and review it again after any change to planner-agent."
          },
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "docs/security/architecture.md"
                },
                "region": {
