          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/repudiation",
          "message": {
            "text": "Failed and rejected attempts against model-gateway are not logged, so probing of prompts and completions leaves no trace that an investigator could use. The weakness sits at layer Foundation Model of the stack, so every workflow that depends on prompts and completions inherits the exposure. Without reliable records an investigation cannot establish who acted, so disputes about responsibility stay unresolved. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
