        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/repudiation",
          "message": {
            "text": "Log entries from audit-ledger can be edited or deleted by the same operators who administer it, so evidence of misuse can be removed after the fact. Because audit-ledger serves the Operations Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of approval and tool call records at once. Incident responders lose the sequence of events, which delays containment and weakens any later accountability claim. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Write the records of audit-ledger to an append-only store that operators cannot modify, and anchor periodic hashes of the log in a separate system. Name an owner for this control, review it each quarter and route violations to trace-collector so that responders see them in one place."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
