            ],
            "affected_assets": []
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "Logs and traces emitted by auth-broker include raw credential assertions and session grants, so anyone with access to the logging pipeline can read content meant for one tenant. The exposure follows from how auth-broker receives credential assertions and session grants from policy-engine and hands them to the next stage without an independent check. The exposed material can be reused for follow-on attacks and may trigger notification duties if it covers customer data. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Redact or tokenise sensitive fields before auth-broker emits logs and traces, and restrict the logging pipeline to the roles that need it. Add a regression test for this abuse path to the CI suite and alert through trace-collector when the control fires."
          },
          "level": "error",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "docs/security/architecture.md"
                },
