        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "Verbose error responses from tool-server-1 reveal internal paths, query text and identifiers of tool call arguments and results to any caller who can trigger a failure. The weakness sits at layer Agent Framework of the stack, so every workflow that depends on tool call arguments and results inherits the exposure. The exposed material can be reused for follow-on attacks and may trigger notification duties if it covers customer data. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
