        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "Secrets such as the service credential for embed-service-2 appear in process arguments and environment dumps that diagnostic tooling captures. vector-store-a trusts embed-service-2 to pass document chunks and query embeddings along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. Disclosure is silent, so the affected parties learn about it only when the information is misused. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Pass the service credential to embed-service-2 through a secret manager mount, exclude it from process listings and diagnostics, and rotate it after any exposure. Track coverage of this control as a release criterion for embed-service-2 and record any exception with an expiry date."
          },
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
