        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "embedded documents and metadata held by vector-store-a are readable by any service in the Data Zone that shares the same network role, because access is granted by network position. Because vector-store-a serves the Data Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of embedded documents and metadata at once. The exposed material can be reused for follow-on attacks and may trigger notification duties if it covers customer data. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and LOW impact because the effect is contained and easy to reverse once it is noticed.",
            "markdown": "Grant access to embedded documents and metadata per workload identity with least privilege, enforce it at vector-store-a and remove network-position trust within the Data Zone. Add a regression test for this abuse path to the CI suite and alert through trace-collector when the control fires."
          },
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "docs/security/architecture.md"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "vector-store-a",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Data Zone/vector-store-a",
                  "kind": "data-store"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "primaryLocationLineHash": "cfe9b03984131775",
            "findingId/v1": "I-25",
            "baselineRunId": "2026-09-21T09-12-00"
          },
          "properties": {
            "baselineState": "unchanged",
            "maestro-layer": "L2 \u2014 Data Operations",
            "tags": [
              "maestro-layer:L2"
            ],
            "affected_assets": []
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "Logs and traces emitted by vector-store-a include raw embedded documents and metadata, so anyone with access to the logging pipeline can read content meant for one tenant. vector-store-a runs in the Data Zone and exchanges embedded documents and metadata with embed-service-2 over PostgreSQL over TLS, so anything able to reach embed-service-2 can also reach this weakness. Disclosure is silent, so the affected parties learn about it only when the information is misused. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Redact or tokenise sensitive fields before vector-store-a emits logs and traces, and restrict the logging pipeline to the roles that need it. Add a regression test for this abuse path to the CI suite and alert through trace-collector when the control fires."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "docs/security/architecture.md"
                },
                "region": {
