        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "approval and tool call records held by audit-ledger are readable by any service in the Operations Zone that shares the same network role, because access is granted by network position. policy-engine trusts audit-ledger to pass approval and tool call records along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. The exposed material can be reused for follow-on attacks and may trigger notification duties if it covers customer data. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Grant access to approval and tool call records per workload identity with least privilege, enforce it at audit-ledger and remove network-position trust within the Operations Zone. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against audit-ledger, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
