          "message": {
            "text": "Expensive queries over task plans and tool selections can be triggered by any authorised caller of planner-agent, so one user can degrade the service for all. policy-engine trusts planner-agent to pass task plans and tool selections along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. Operators lose the ability to book or amend shipments while the condition lasts, and recovery depends on manual intervention. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
