        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/denial-of-service",
          "message": {
            "text": "A dependency of model-gateway becomes unavailable and the failure cascades because model-gateway waits on it synchronously for every request. The exposure follows from how model-gateway receives prompts and completions from planner-agent and hands them to the next stage without an independent check. The outage propagates to dependent agents, which stall or retry and prolong the disruption. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Isolate calls from model-gateway to the dependency with timeouts and bulkheads, serve degraded results where possible and alert on dependency health. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against model-gateway, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "error",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "docs/security/architecture.md"
                },
