        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/denial-of-service",
          "message": {
            "text": "Expensive queries over prompts and completions can be triggered by any authorised caller of model-gateway, so one user can degrade the service for all. model-gateway runs in the Agent Runtime Zone and exchanges prompts and completions with planner-agent over HTTPS (TLS 1.3), so anything able to reach planner-agent can also reach this weakness. Operators lose the ability to book or amend shipments while the condition lasts, and recovery depends on manual intervention. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and LOW impact because the effect is contained and easy to reverse once it is noticed.",
            "markdown": "Enforce cost limits and pagination on queries to model-gateway, run heavy work on a separate pool and cancel queries that exceed the budget. Name an owner for this control, review it each quarter and route violations to trace-collector so that responders see them in one place."
          },
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
