          "message": {
            "text": "A dependency of eval-runner becomes unavailable and the failure cascades because eval-runner waits on it synchronously for every request. Because eval-runner serves the Operations Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of replayed traces and judge verdicts at once. Operators lose the ability to book or amend shipments while the condition lasts, and recovery depends on manual intervention. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Isolate calls from eval-runner to the dependency with timeouts and bulkheads, serve degraded results where possible and alert on dependency health. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against eval-runner, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "error",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
