        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/denial-of-service",
          "message": {
            "text": "Expensive queries over approval and tool call records can be triggered by any authorised caller of audit-ledger, so one user can degrade the service for all. audit-ledger runs in the Operations Zone and exchanges approval and tool call records with reviewer-agent over gRPC over mTLS, so anything able to reach reviewer-agent can also reach this weakness. Operators lose the ability to book or amend shipments while the condition lasts, and recovery depends on manual intervention. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and LOW impact because the effect is contained and easy to reverse once it is noticed.",
            "markdown": "Enforce cost limits and pagination on queries to audit-ledger, run heavy work on a separate pool and cancel queries that exceed the budget. Track coverage of this control as a release criterion for audit-ledger and record any exception with an expiry date."
          },
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
