        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/elevation-of-privilege",
          "message": {
            "text": "An administrative interface of intake-agent is reachable from the same network as ordinary callers and relies on a single shared password. trace-collector trusts intake-agent to pass free-text shipment requests along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. Once the boundary is crossed the attacker can reach administrative functions and persist there. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Move the administrative interface of intake-agent behind a separate listener with strong authentication, network restriction and per-user accounts. Verify the control in a pre-production exercise and review it again after any change to intake-agent."
