        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/elevation-of-privilege",
          "message": {
            "text": "Role claims carried in the model API key presented to model-gateway are honoured without confirmation against the authoritative directory. The weakness sits at layer Foundation Model of the stack, so every workflow that depends on prompts and completions inherits the exposure. Once the boundary is crossed the attacker can reach administrative functions and persist there. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Resolve roles for model-gateway from the authoritative directory on each request or from a short cache, and ignore role claims supplied by the caller. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against model-gateway, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
