        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/elevation-of-privilege",
          "message": {
            "text": "An administrative interface of summarizer-llm is reachable from the same network as ordinary callers and relies on a single shared password. The weakness sits at layer Foundation Model of the stack, so every workflow that depends on shipment records fed into summaries inherits the exposure. Once the boundary is crossed the attacker can reach administrative functions and persist there. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Move the administrative interface of summarizer-llm behind a separate listener with strong authentication, network restriction and per-user accounts. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against summarizer-llm, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
