        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/agentic-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "The goal or instruction set of worker-2 can be changed through content it reads, steering it toward actions its operators never intended. The exposure follows from how worker-2 receives work orders and route candidates from router-agent and hands them to the next stage without an independent check. Actions taken by the agent look legitimate in the logs, which slows detection and complicates rollback. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Keep the goals of worker-2 in signed configuration that content cannot alter, and refuse plan changes that originate from retrieved text. Track coverage of this control as a release criterion for worker-2 and record any exception with an expiry date."
