        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/agentic-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "The goal or instruction set of tool-server-1 can be changed through content it reads, steering it toward actions its operators never intended. Because tool-server-1 serves the Agent Runtime Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of tool call arguments and results at once. The agent acts at machine speed on behalf of the operator, so a single manipulated decision can cause many unwanted changes before a person notices. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Keep the goals of tool-server-1 in signed configuration that content cannot alter, and refuse plan changes that originate from retrieved text. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against tool-server-1, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "error",
