        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "intake-agent passes conversation history from earlier turns into the model unchanged, so an injection planted earlier keeps working in later turns. The weakness sits at layer Agent Framework of the stack, so every workflow that depends on free-text shipment requests inherits the exposure. The failure is probabilistic, so it may pass pre-release testing and appear only under adversarial input. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
