        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Encoded or multilingual payloads bypass the keyword filter in front of router-agent, which only checks plain English text. planner-agent trusts router-agent to pass subtask assignments along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. The answers or side effects of the model then serve the attacker's goal, and the behaviour can be repeated against every user of the component. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
