          "message": {
            "text": "Prompt content logged by planner-agent is later replayed to router-agent for evaluation, carrying planted instructions into a trusted context. router-agent runs in the Agent Runtime Zone and exchanges subtask assignments with planner-agent over HTTP/2 over mTLS, so anything able to reach planner-agent can also reach this weakness. The answers or side effects of the model then serve the attacker's goal, and the behaviour can be repeated against every user of the component. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
