          "message": {
            "text": "worker-3 follows links and files named in work orders and draft documents, which turns a harmless-looking request into a fetch of attacker-controlled content. worker-3 runs in the Agent Runtime Zone and exchanges work orders and draft documents with trace-collector over OTLP over TLS, so anything able to reach trace-collector can also reach this weakness. The failure is probabilistic, so it may pass pre-release testing and appear only under adversarial input. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
