        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "A delayed trigger planted in prompts, completions and tool traces on trace-collector changes behaviour only after a date or phrase, so pre-release testing never sees it. The exposure follows from how trace-collector receives prompts, completions and tool traces from worker-3 and hands them to the next stage without an independent check. The failure is probabilistic, so it may pass pre-release testing and appear only under adversarial input. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Scan prompts, completions and tool traces on trace-collector for trigger-like strings, test with date and phrase perturbations and keep immutable snapshots for rollback. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against trace-collector, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "warning",
