          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Anyone who can write to the ingestion path of eval-runner can slip in documents that contradict authoritative sources. The weakness sits at layer Evaluation and Observability of the stack, so every workflow that depends on replayed traces and judge verdicts inherits the exposure. The failure is probabilistic, so it may pass pre-release testing and appear only under adversarial input. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Restrict write access to the ingestion path of eval-runner, sign documents from authoritative sources and prefer them when answers conflict. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against eval-runner, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
