        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Records written into eval-runner by low-trust sources are later used as ground truth, so an attacker who plants entries shifts model answers. eval-runner runs in the Operations Zone and exchanges replayed traces and judge verdicts with feature-store-2 over PostgreSQL over TLS, so anything able to reach feature-store-2 can also reach this weakness. The answers or side effects of the model then serve the attacker's goal, and the behaviour can be repeated against every user of the component. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Record provenance for every entry in eval-runner, require review for low-trust sources and exclude unreviewed entries from retrieval and training. Verify the control in a pre-production exercise and review it again after any change to eval-runner."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
