        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Model weights or adapters served by embed-service-2 are readable by operators and by any process sharing the host. intake-agent trusts embed-service-2 to pass document chunks and query embeddings along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. The answers or side effects of the model then serve the attacker's goal, and the behaviour can be repeated against every user of the component. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Store the weights for embed-service-2 encrypted with keys in a hardware-backed service, restrict loading to the serving identity and audit every access. Name an owner for this control, review it each quarter and route violations to trace-collector so that responders see them in one place."
