          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Instructions hidden in shipment records fed into summaries reach the prompt of summarizer-llm and override its system guidance, because content and instructions share one context. summarizer-llm runs in the Agent Runtime Zone and exchanges shipment records fed into summaries with worker-3 over gRPC over mTLS, so anything able to reach worker-3 can also reach this weakness. The failure is probabilistic, so it may pass pre-release testing and appear only under adversarial input. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
