            ],
            "affected_assets": []
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Text generated by intake-agent is placed into a database query or shell argument without parameterisation, allowing the model to be steered into injection. Because intake-agent serves the Agent Runtime Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of free-text shipment requests at once. Downstream components cannot tell the model's output from validated input, so no later layer is likely to catch it. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Never build queries or commands from model output of intake-agent: use parameterised calls and fixed argument vectors with allowlisted values. Track coverage of this control as a release criterion for intake-agent and record any exception with an expiry date."
          },
          "level": "error",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "docs/security/architecture.md"
                },
