        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Structured output from intake-agent is trusted by edge-gateway as already validated, so a malformed field flows straight into business logic. The exposure follows from how intake-agent receives free-text shipment requests from edge-gateway and hands them to the next stage without an independent check. The unsafe output reaches an interpreter that trusts it, turning a text generation problem into code or request execution. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Validate the output of intake-agent against a strict schema in edge-gateway, treat it as untrusted input and reject anything that fails. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against intake-agent, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
