          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Outputs from reviewer-agent flow into decisions without a review step, so one wrong answer is repeated across many shipments. edge-gateway trusts reviewer-agent to pass drafted proposals awaiting review along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. Operators act on the wrong information, and the error is copied into shipments, documents and customer communication. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and LOW impact because the effect is contained and easy to reverse once it is noticed.",
