        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/agentic-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "intake-agent builds rapport over long sessions and starts to share unprompted details about earlier operators. trace-collector trusts intake-agent to pass free-text shipment requests along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. The effect builds over time as users come to rely on the agent's tone instead of its evidence. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Isolate sessions of intake-agent per operator, forbid recall of other operators' details and review long sessions for rapport patterns. Confirm the fix with a targeted test against intake-agent, and keep the evidence with the change record for later audits."
          },
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
            {
