        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/agentic-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "intake-agent speaks with an authoritative tone about customs and legal matters, and operators may defer to it without checking. The exposure follows from how intake-agent receives free-text shipment requests from queue-a2 and hands them to the next stage without an independent check. People defer to the agent more than its reliability justifies, which weakens the human oversight the design depends on. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
            "markdown": "Label the output of intake-agent as machine generated, state its limits plainly and avoid wording that claims professional authority. Verify the control in a pre-production exercise and review it again after any change to intake-agent."
